  "url": "#def-strict-milnor",
  "type": "Definition",
  "number": "1.2",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  A commutative square of complete Tate -algebras is a strict Milnor square if it is cartesian, the sequence of underlying topological -vector spaces is strict exact, and is a strict surjection.   "
