  "body": "  The ring is an integral domain but is not uniform.   Lean (chart is a domain)  Lean (chart is nonuniform)   The coefficient description gives a homomorphism It is a homomorphism by . If its image is zero, then for every . Since is a domain, every is zero. The map is therefore injective. Its target is a domain, and hence so is .  Inside write and put Formula gives The even powers of have norm at most , and the odd powers have norm at most . Thus every is power-bounded. The family is not bounded, since its norms are unbounded. Hence is unbounded and is not uniform.   "
